<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">Running like a fugitive,</font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">isoi de iru</font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">being chased by something.</font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:27,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">kawai ta mune ga</font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:27,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">Inside my heart is pounding,</font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:30,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">kari tateru no sa</font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:30,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">my throat dry like it's withering.</font></b></font></font>

13
