<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">iki o tsunete hashiri nukero yami o saite</font></b></font></font>

22
00:00:55,070 --> 00:01:00,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">Stifling our breath, reaching for beyond, tearing through the dark.</font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">tatakau koto mo aishi au koto mo</font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">In fighting and in love.</font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:13,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">owari wa shinai</font></b></font></font>

26
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:13,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">To the distant light above,</font></b></font></font>

27
00:01:13,890 --> 00:01:16,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">ON THE WAY</font></b></font></font>

28
00:01:13,890 --> 00:01:16,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:28,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:28,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:35,030 --> 00:01:37,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're an embarrassment
to our village.</font>

32
00:01:37,570 --> 00:01:40,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you think we came all
the way here to Leaf Village?</font>

33
00:01:40,660 --> 00:01:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">P-Please listen to me, Gaara.</font>

34
00:01:43,870 --> 00:01:46,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-They lashed out first...</font>

35
00:01:46,660 --> 00:01:47,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

36
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kill you.</font>

37
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:55,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">U-Understood, I was wrong.</font>

38
00:01:56,050 --> 00:01:58,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm sorry...
I'm really sorry.</font>

39
00:01:59,390 --> 00:02:01,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry about that...</font>

40
00:02:02,850 --> 00:02:06,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy... has a nasty look.</font>

41
00:02:06,890 --> 00:02:08,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think he was able to hit
that Kankuro</font>

42
00:02:08,980 --> 00:02:10,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with a tiny rock with great ease.</font>

43
00:02:11,610 --> 00:02:13,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy's... good.</font>

44
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:20,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go.</font>

45
00:02:20,530 --> 00:02:22,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We didn't come here
to play around.</font>

46
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:24,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know.</font>

47
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

48
00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:28,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

49
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Judging from your headbands,</font>

50
00:02:30,330 --> 00:02:33,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're Ninja from the Village
Hidden in the Sand, right?</font>

51
00:02:34,750 --> 00:02:37,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without question, the Land of Fire and
the Land of Wind are allied nations.</font>

52
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the arbitrary coming and
going of Shinobi</font>

53
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:41,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is supposed to
be prohibited by the treaty.</font>

54
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:43,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">State your purpose!</font>

55
00:02:43,890 --> 00:02:45,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Depending on circumstances...</font>

56
00:02:45,100 --> 00:02:47,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph! So this is what they mean</font>

57
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by the darkest place being
under the candlestick.</font>

58
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:50,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you know anything about it?</font>

59
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My permit!</font>

60
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you say, we're Sand Village Genin
from the Land of Wind.</font>

61
00:02:59,780 --> 00:03:02,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We came to this village to
take the Chunin Exam.</font>

62
00:03:03,490 --> 00:03:05,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chunin Exam...?</font>

63
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:12,130
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Identify</font>

64
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:12,130
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Yourselves!</font>

65
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:12,130
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Powerful Enemies</font>

66
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:12,130
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">That Have Arrived!!</font>

67
00:03:12,670 --> 00:03:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is the Chunin Exam anyways?</font>

68
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:18,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really don't know
anything, do you?</font>

69
00:03:19,300 --> 00:03:24,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-chan, if you pass the exam,
you can become a Chunin from a Genin!</font>

70
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:27,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see! Then, maybe I'll try taking them!</font>

71
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:28,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh!</font>

72
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:31,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! You there...</font>

73
00:03:32,350 --> 00:03:33,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's your name?</font>

74
00:03:33,690 --> 00:03:35,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? M-Me?</font>

75
00:03:35,820 --> 00:03:38,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! The gourd next to you!</font>

76
00:03:40,820 --> 00:03:43,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Gaara of the desert...</font>

77
00:03:43,910 --> 00:03:45,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have an interest in you as well...</font>

78
00:03:46,580 --> 00:03:47,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's your name?</font>

79
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:50,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke.</font>

80
00:03:57,500 --> 00:03:59,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say! Say! What about me?
What about me?</font>

81
00:04:00,630 --> 00:04:01,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not interested.</font>

82
00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:08,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh! Things have gotten interesting.</font>

83
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru, do I look weak?</font>

84
00:04:13,190 --> 00:04:15,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Compared to Sasuke nii-chan, yes...</font>

85
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:19,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke, I won't lose to you!</font>

86
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:21,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's gotten into you,
all of a sudden?!</font>

87
00:04:21,860 --> 00:04:22,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think?</font>

88
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:25,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think they're anything special.</font>

89
00:04:26,410 --> 00:04:29,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the black-haired one from Leaf Village
and the gourd from the Sand Village...</font>

90
00:04:29,330 --> 00:04:31,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">those two need to be checked.</font>

91
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:37,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, in conjunction
with beginning the Chunin Exam,</font>

92
00:04:38,090 --> 00:04:42,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">let us first have those in charge
of the rookie Genin come forward.</font>

93
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:46,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi and Kurenai and Asuma...</font>

94
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:50,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So? Are there any Genin from
your teams</font>

95
00:04:50,930 --> 00:04:54,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you wish to recommend
for these exams?</font>

96
00:04:55,770 --> 00:04:57,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It goes without saying,</font>

97
00:04:57,770 --> 00:05:02,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but if it's a Genin who has carried out
eight or more formal missions,</font>

98
00:05:02,150 --> 00:05:05,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can recommend them
for the exams if you wish.</font>

99
00:05:05,990 --> 00:05:07,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, as a general rule,</font>

100
00:05:07,870 --> 00:05:11,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">having carried out more than twice
that amount of missions is appropriate.</font>

101
00:05:12,370 --> 00:05:13,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to hear this...</font>

102
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:16,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too soon for them.</font>

103
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, you first Kakashi.</font>

104
00:05:19,790 --> 00:05:21,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Kakashi-led Team 7...</font>

105
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:26,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke. Uzumaki Naruto.
Haruno Sakura.</font>

106
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:33,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I, Hatake Kakashi, recommend these
three for the Chunin Exam.</font>

107
00:05:34,140 --> 00:05:34,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

108
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:37,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Kurenai-led Team 8...</font>

109
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:41,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hyuga Hinata, Inuzuka Kiba,
Aburame Shino.</font>

110
00:05:42,190 --> 00:05:46,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These three, I, Yuhi Kurenai,
recommend the same.</font>

111
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:49,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Asuma-led Team 10...</font>

112
00:05:49,530 --> 00:05:54,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yamanaka Ino, Nara Shikamaru,
Akimichi Choji.</font>

113
00:05:54,580 --> 00:05:58,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These three, I, Sarutobi Asuma,
recommend the same.</font>

114
00:05:59,130 --> 00:06:00,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All three recommended...</font>

115
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think rookies will be
in the Chunin Exam...</font>

116
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hasn't it been five years
since that's happened?</font>

117
00:06:05,460 --> 00:06:06,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm...</font>

118
00:06:06,300 --> 00:06:07,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait a minute!</font>

119
00:06:08,130 --> 00:06:09,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Iruka?</font>

120
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:12,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama, please let me
say one thing.</font>

121
00:06:12,470 --> 00:06:14,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This may be presumptuous,</font>

122
00:06:14,140 --> 00:06:16,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but as for the nine names
that were given,</font>

123
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:18,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was in charge of them at the Academy.</font>

124
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Admittedly, they were all students
with ability,</font>

125
00:06:22,060 --> 00:06:23,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it's too soon...!</font>

126
00:06:24,150 --> 00:06:27,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They should be tested after
having gained more experience!</font>

127
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:32,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I became a Chunin when I was
six years younger than Naruto is now.</font>

128
00:06:32,990 --> 00:06:34,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto is different from you!</font>

129
00:06:35,540 --> 00:06:37,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it your intent to crush Naruto?!</font>

130
00:06:38,250 --> 00:06:41,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They always do nothing but complain
about important missions...</font>

131
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:44,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Teaching them a lesson
once would be fun.</font>

132
00:06:44,750 --> 00:06:46,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Trying to crush them
would be interesting, too.</font>

133
00:06:47,470 --> 00:06:48,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What did you say?!</font>

134
00:06:49,470 --> 00:06:51,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, joking aside...</font>

135
00:06:52,970 --> 00:06:54,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei...</font>

136
00:06:55,180 --> 00:06:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand what you want to say.</font>

137
00:06:57,770 --> 00:07:00,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's aggravating, I know.
However...</font>

138
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:01,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi...</font>

139
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:02,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't do it.</font>

140
00:07:03,810 --> 00:07:07,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stay out of this!
They're not your students anymore!</font>

141
00:07:08,030 --> 00:07:10,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now they're my subordinates!</font>

142
00:07:12,950 --> 00:07:15,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man... troublesome people.</font>

143
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:23,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But the Chunin Exam
is also known as...</font>

144
00:07:23,790 --> 00:07:24,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka...</font>

145
00:07:25,670 --> 00:07:28,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand your point.</font>

146
00:07:29,220 --> 00:07:30,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama...</font>

147
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:33,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, I have decided to conduct</font>

148
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:36,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a special preliminary exam
for these rookie Genin.</font>

149
00:07:37,220 --> 00:07:39,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">P-Preliminary exam...?!</font>

150
00:07:49,570 --> 00:07:50,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hey! Hey!</font>

151
00:07:50,990 --> 00:07:52,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it that he's the one who
always calls us out,</font>

152
00:07:52,990 --> 00:07:54,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and then makes us wait?!</font>

153
00:07:54,570 --> 00:07:55,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right! That's right!</font>

154
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:58,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's he going to do about
the feelings of a maiden</font>

155
00:07:58,290 --> 00:08:01,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who accidentally overslept and resigned
herself to no blow-drying?!</font>

156
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:04,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I overslept, so I haven't washed my face
and didn't brush my teeth.</font>

157
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:09,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You... That's dirty.</font>

158
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:13,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why're these guys so hyper
first thing in the morning?!</font>

159
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:18,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, good morning, folks!</font>

160
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:22,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today, I got a bit lost on the path of life...</font>

161
00:08:22,270 --> 00:08:23,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right! That's a lie!!</font>

162
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:26,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, well...</font>

163
00:08:26,610 --> 00:08:30,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is sudden, but I recommended
you guys for the Chunin Exam, so...</font>

164
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:33,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, these are your applications.</font>

165
00:08:33,530 --> 00:08:34,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chunin Exam...</font>

166
00:08:35,610 --> 00:08:38,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That being said, the recommendations
are not compulsory.</font>

167
00:08:38,490 --> 00:08:42,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are free to decide whether
you take the Exam or not.</font>

168
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:44,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! I love you, Kakashi-sensei!</font>

169
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, cut it out. Get away already...</font>

170
00:08:47,380 --> 00:08:50,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only those who want to take the Exam,
sign that application and</font>

171
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:55,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">come to Room 301 of the Academy
at 3:00 p.m. five days from now...</font>

172
00:08:55,380 --> 00:08:56,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it!</font>

173
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chunin Exam! Chunin Exam!</font>

174
00:09:06,150 --> 00:09:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chunin Exams, eh...</font>

175
00:09:08,810 --> 00:09:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I bet lots of strong guys would be there...</font>

176
00:09:12,570 --> 00:09:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For example, that guy!</font>

177
00:09:16,160 --> 00:09:17,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And this guy!</font>

178
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:27,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! I won't lose to
anybody no matter what!</font>

179
00:09:28,750 --> 00:09:32,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I take the first place, the path to
the Hokage is right there!</font>

180
00:09:33,170 --> 00:09:37,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough, it's decided that Naruto
will be the Hokage...</font>

181
00:09:37,180 --> 00:09:39,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll just retire my elderly self at once.</font>

182
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:40,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yay!</font>

183
00:09:44,180 --> 00:09:46,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I might be able to fight him.</font>

184
00:09:54,610 --> 00:09:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... don't want to...</font>

185
00:09:57,860 --> 00:09:58,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I can't...</font>

186
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:01,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">keep up with Sasuke-kun,
and not even with Naruto...</font>

187
00:10:01,580 --> 00:10:03,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chunin Exam, no way...</font>

188
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:29,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Naruto nii-chan! Let's play!</font>

189
00:10:30,020 --> 00:10:34,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure. I don't have any missions today,
so I'll play with you guys!</font>

190
00:10:34,570 --> 00:10:36,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yay!</font>

191
00:10:37,070 --> 00:10:37,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

192
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:46,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leader! Konohamaru-chan!</font>

193
00:10:46,330 --> 00:10:48,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you going to do with Moegi?!</font>

194
00:10:48,620 --> 00:10:50,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you! Let Moegi go!</font>

195
00:10:54,250 --> 00:10:56,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!
Let's follow them, Konohamaru!</font>

196
00:10:56,670 --> 00:10:57,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yeah!</font>

197
00:10:58,220 --> 00:10:59,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wait!</font>

198
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:12,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chunin Exams, eh...</font>

199
00:11:13,610 --> 00:11:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yo.</font>

200
00:11:14,690 --> 00:11:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sasuke-kun, what's up?</font>

201
00:11:17,940 --> 00:11:19,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about we go for a little walk?</font>

202
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:22,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way! For real?!</font>

203
00:11:25,740 --> 00:11:28,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well well... So you can keep up
at this speed, eh?</font>

204
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:32,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait for me! Moegi!</font>

205
00:11:35,920 --> 00:11:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-chan, where'd you go?</font>

206
00:11:38,510 --> 00:11:40,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think we are lost.</font>

207
00:11:40,670 --> 00:11:42,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! Let me go!</font>

208
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:46,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even the strongly fortified
Village Hidden in the Leaf...</font>

209
00:11:47,470 --> 00:11:51,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is mine if I slip in the
middle of Chunin Exam's ruckus.</font>

210
00:11:51,390 --> 00:11:52,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

211
00:11:53,100 --> 00:11:54,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was fast...</font>

212
00:11:54,810 --> 00:11:56,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! You fat old man!</font>

213
00:11:56,770 --> 00:11:58,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you going to do with Moegi?</font>

214
00:11:59,190 --> 00:12:00,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What am I going to do, you ask?</font>

215
00:12:02,530 --> 00:12:03,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You want to know?</font>

216
00:12:04,070 --> 00:12:04,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!
Don't move!</font>

217
00:12:05,870 --> 00:12:07,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you do,
the brat's dead meat!</font>

218
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:11,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You. Why're you doing this?!</font>

219
00:12:11,830 --> 00:12:14,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want the first Hokage's
Scroll of Sealing!</font>

220
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:16,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you bring it to me,
I'll return the brat!</font>

221
00:12:17,090 --> 00:12:18,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scroll of Sealing...</font>

222
00:12:21,050 --> 00:12:21,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm...</font>

223
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:23,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

224
00:12:24,590 --> 00:12:25,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up, all of a sudden?</font>

225
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:27,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

226
00:12:28,350 --> 00:12:32,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give up on the Chunin Exam...
It's too early for you.</font>

227
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:34,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it...?</font>

228
00:12:34,770 --> 00:12:35,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought so...</font>

229
00:12:36,650 --> 00:12:38,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chunin Exam is
a gathering of top dogs...</font>

230
00:12:39,610 --> 00:12:42,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You might die if you're not careful...</font>

231
00:12:43,070 --> 00:12:44,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

232
00:12:44,320 --> 00:12:46,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're worried about me, right?</font>

233
00:12:46,950 --> 00:12:48,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... kind of...</font>

234
00:12:50,660 --> 00:12:52,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a display of affection, eh?</font>

235
00:12:52,660 --> 00:12:54,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get lost! If you don't want to die.</font>

236
00:12:54,870 --> 00:12:56,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't talk as if you know everything!</font>

237
00:12:59,250 --> 00:13:00,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't make me angry!</font>

238
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:01,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

239
00:13:04,170 --> 00:13:05,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't take me lightly!</font>

240
00:13:10,350 --> 00:13:11,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

241
00:13:25,110 --> 00:13:26,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun?</font>

242
00:13:27,410 --> 00:13:28,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

243
00:13:28,370 --> 00:13:29,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!!</font>

244
00:13:33,830 --> 00:13:35,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing?</font>

245
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:36,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and bring me
the Scroll of Sealing!</font>

246
00:13:37,170 --> 00:13:40,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What'll happen... if I say, hell no?</font>

247
00:13:40,790 --> 00:13:43,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't care what happens
to this brat?</font>

248
00:13:43,380 --> 00:13:47,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh, I'm fine with whatever happens
to that bunch of straw.</font>

249
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:50,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!
When did he do that?!</font>

250
00:13:52,560 --> 00:13:55,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've taken Moegi back from you,
thank you!</font>

251
00:13:55,350 --> 00:13:58,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As expected great leader!
Moegi-san respects you.</font>

252
00:13:58,440 --> 00:14:01,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! The Clone Jutsu, huh...?</font>

253
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:03,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't know when to give up!</font>

254
00:14:07,610 --> 00:14:08,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto nii-chan!</font>

255
00:14:09,450 --> 00:14:11,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! You're late, Konohamaru!</font>

256
00:14:11,780 --> 00:14:14,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru-chan, I was scared.</font>

257
00:14:14,370 --> 00:14:16,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, there-there...</font>

258
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:18,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leader, did you catch him?</font>

259
00:14:20,420 --> 00:14:22,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup, as you can see!</font>

260
00:14:22,500 --> 00:14:23,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What?!</font>

261
00:14:23,750 --> 00:14:26,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's the Substitution Jutsu!</font>

262
00:14:26,050 --> 00:14:28,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! When did he switch?!</font>

263
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:30,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

264
00:14:35,850 --> 00:14:37,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't want to turn out
like this,</font>

265
00:14:37,310 --> 00:14:39,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you'll give up on
the Chunin Exam, too.</font>

266
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:42,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, don't die...!</font>

267
00:14:43,520 --> 00:14:46,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big mistake if you think
I'd say that.</font>

268
00:14:46,650 --> 00:14:48,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was aware of this Genjutsu
right from the start!</font>

269
00:14:49,030 --> 00:14:49,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

270
00:14:50,450 --> 00:14:52,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real Sasuke-kun wouldn't do
something like</font>

271
00:14:52,410 --> 00:14:54,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">invite me to go for a walk!</font>

272
00:14:55,410 --> 00:14:56,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't make me say
such frustrating things!</font>

273
00:14:57,620 --> 00:15:00,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kind of elementary Genjutsu
won't work on me!</font>

274
00:15:01,710 --> 00:15:03,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you say elementary...?</font>

275
00:15:03,630 --> 00:15:04,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

276
00:15:04,500 --> 00:15:07,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Incidentally, I've seen through that
you're also an illusion</font>

277
00:15:07,090 --> 00:15:09,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and aren't really here!</font>

278
00:15:11,340 --> 00:15:12,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know about...</font>

279
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:13,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that!</font>

280
00:15:19,350 --> 00:15:20,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See?</font>

281
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:24,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just what I'd expect of
Kakashi's subordinate.</font>

282
00:15:24,570 --> 00:15:27,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, this will become reality
in the Chunin Exam!</font>

283
00:15:27,990 --> 00:15:30,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if you can endure that...?</font>

284
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:33,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not scared!
I'll take them on anytime!</font>

285
00:15:34,580 --> 00:15:37,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chunin Exam isn't...
The Chunin Exam isn't...!</font>

286
00:15:39,330 --> 00:15:41,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm still not sure if I can do it...</font>

287
00:15:49,550 --> 00:15:51,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was a stupid thing to do...</font>

288
00:15:59,430 --> 00:16:00,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How was it?</font>

289
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:03,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We went to the trouble of having
a special preliminary exam,</font>

290
00:16:03,520 --> 00:16:06,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but all nine of the rookies passed.</font>

291
00:16:08,650 --> 00:16:13,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you say, it appears their skills
have definitely improved.</font>

292
00:16:13,700 --> 00:16:19,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, the actual Chunin Exam
won't just end at this, but...</font>

293
00:16:21,290 --> 00:16:22,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, have you heard?</font>

294
00:16:22,790 --> 00:16:24,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rookies are going to be
in the Chunin Exam</font>

295
00:16:24,370 --> 00:16:26,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the first time in five years.</font>

296
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way.</font>

297
00:16:28,550 --> 00:16:31,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's probably just a Jonin battle of wills
or something anyway.</font>

298
00:16:32,260 --> 00:16:33,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

299
00:16:33,380 --> 00:16:36,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The story is that three among them
are that Kakashi's unit.</font>

300
00:16:37,350 --> 00:16:39,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's interesting...</font>

301
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:41,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, be that as it may...</font>

302
00:16:43,690 --> 00:16:45,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a sad story...</font>

303
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:52,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan, you're late!</font>

304
00:16:52,780 --> 00:16:54,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... sorry...</font>

305
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:03,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Morning, Sasuke-kun.</font>

306
00:17:04,210 --> 00:17:04,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

307
00:17:06,210 --> 00:17:08,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something's strange about Sakura.</font>

308
00:17:15,800 --> 00:17:18,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, are you sure you're going
to attempt taking</font>

309
00:17:18,260 --> 00:17:19,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Chunin Exam with that skill?</font>

310
00:17:19,850 --> 00:17:22,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">May it'd be best if you runts quit.</font>

311
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:25,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're green-assed brats, after all.</font>

312
00:17:26,270 --> 00:17:28,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please let us through.</font>

313
00:17:33,820 --> 00:17:34,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's... mean...</font>

314
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:37,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!</font>

315
00:17:37,700 --> 00:17:41,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen!
We're being nice to you!</font>

316
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:43,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chunin Exam is a high hurdle.</font>

317
00:17:43,910 --> 00:17:46,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Many times have we seen
people quit Shinobi</font>

318
00:17:46,330 --> 00:17:49,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as well as people who were
disabled for life</font>

319
00:17:49,590 --> 00:17:52,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">just because they took this Exam.</font>

320
00:17:52,460 --> 00:17:56,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, a Chunin is at the level
of a unit leader.</font>

321
00:17:56,220 --> 00:17:58,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mission failures,
death of subordinates,</font>

322
00:17:58,510 --> 00:18:00,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's all part of the
responsibilities of a leader!</font>

323
00:18:00,760 --> 00:18:02,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A brat such as this a Chunin?</font>

324
00:18:04,430 --> 00:18:08,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's so bad about weeding out
those who won't pass anyway?!</font>

325
00:18:09,060 --> 00:18:10,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A just argument.</font>

326
00:18:10,730 --> 00:18:13,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, you will let me through.</font>

327
00:18:14,780 --> 00:18:18,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And could you also immediately
undo this barrier created with Genjutsu?</font>

328
00:18:19,450 --> 00:18:21,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have business on the third floor.</font>

329
00:18:22,280 --> 00:18:23,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this guy talking about...?</font>

330
00:18:23,950 --> 00:18:25,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know...</font>

331
00:18:25,450 --> 00:18:28,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Well, well...
— So you noticed, eh?</font>

332
00:18:29,830 --> 00:18:31,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about it, Sakura?</font>

333
00:18:31,340 --> 00:18:33,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should've been
the first one to realize it.</font>

334
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:34,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

335
00:18:34,590 --> 00:18:37,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your analytical strength and
Genjutsu know-how</font>

336
00:18:37,130 --> 00:18:40,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">has improved the most in our squad, so...</font>

337
00:18:40,800 --> 00:18:42,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

338
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:44,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you...</font>

339
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:48,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course. I realized it ages ago!</font>

340
00:18:48,520 --> 00:18:50,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You see, this is the second floor!</font>

341
00:18:50,730 --> 00:18:51,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup!</font>

342
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:59,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, not bad...
But all you've done is to catch on.</font>

343
00:19:00,110 --> 00:19:00,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right?!</font>

344
00:19:11,630 --> 00:19:12,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-He's fast!</font>

345
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:13,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This person...</font>

346
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:16,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a different person from
when he was getting punched before!</font>

347
00:19:18,550 --> 00:19:20,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He stopped my kick...</font>

348
00:19:20,130 --> 00:19:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with that Chakra in his arm?</font>

349
00:19:23,010 --> 00:19:25,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, this isn't what you promised.</font>

350
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:27,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were the one who said</font>

351
00:19:27,180 --> 00:19:29,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you didn't want to carelessly
attract attention and be watched.</font>

352
00:19:30,140 --> 00:19:31,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

353
00:19:32,020 --> 00:19:34,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh boy...
This again...</font>

354
00:19:35,770 --> 00:19:36,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...</font>

355
00:19:37,530 --> 00:19:39,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The marks where he was hit
are disappearing.</font>

356
00:19:40,150 --> 00:19:41,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was he faking?</font>

357
00:19:44,370 --> 00:19:47,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name's Rock Lee.
Your name's Sakura-san, right...?</font>

358
00:19:49,040 --> 00:19:49,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

359
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:55,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please go out with me!
I'll protect you until I die!</font>

360
00:19:57,250 --> 00:19:59,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Absolutely... not.</font>

361
00:20:00,550 --> 00:20:01,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

362
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:04,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're... too intense.</font>

363
00:20:07,220 --> 00:20:08,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you there.</font>

364
00:20:09,770 --> 00:20:10,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Identify yourself.</font>

365
00:20:12,730 --> 00:20:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Again?</font>

366
00:20:14,060 --> 00:20:15,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's always about Sasuke!</font>

367
00:20:16,150 --> 00:20:19,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When asking someone his name,
give your own name first.</font>

368
00:20:19,780 --> 00:20:23,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're... a rookie, right?
How old are you?</font>

369
00:20:24,110 --> 00:20:25,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not obliged to answer.</font>

370
00:20:26,280 --> 00:20:27,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

371
00:20:28,790 --> 00:20:29,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cute.</font>

372
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:36,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too intense, huh...</font>

373
00:20:37,710 --> 00:20:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uninterested, huh...</font>

374
00:20:40,380 --> 00:20:43,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then!
Sasuke-kun, Naruto, let's go!</font>

375
00:20:45,090 --> 00:20:48,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So those are Kakashi and
Guy's treasured brats.</font>

376
00:20:49,140 --> 00:20:52,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, for the time being,
their applications will pass.</font>

377
00:20:53,020 --> 00:20:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

378
00:20:55,810 --> 00:20:58,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears this year's test-takers
will be amusing...</font>

379
00:20:59,690 --> 00:21:02,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For us proctors too, eh.</font>

380
00:21:04,990 --> 00:21:06,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good grief...</font>

381
00:21:06,620 --> 00:21:10,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Chunin Exam...
is full of monsters.</font>

382
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:36,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

383
00:21:36,780 --> 00:21:40,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

384
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:43,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

385
00:21:43,410 --> 00:21:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

386
00:21:50,590 --> 00:21:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

387
00:21:53,840 --> 00:21:57,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Sneaking out of the classroom, by the back door.</font></b></font></font></font>

388
00:21:57,180 --> 00:22:00,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">A man railed at me twice though, but I didn't care.</font></b></font></font></font>

389
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:04,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Waiting is wasting for people like me.</font></b></font></font></font>

390
00:22:04,310 --> 00:22:07,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

391
00:22:07,310 --> 00:22:10,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

392
00:22:10,770 --> 00:22:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

393
00:22:14,360 --> 00:22:17,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

394
00:22:27,330 --> 00:22:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

395
00:22:30,670 --> 00:22:34,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

396
00:22:34,050 --> 00:22:37,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

397
00:22:37,380 --> 00:22:41,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

398
00:22:41,010 --> 00:22:44,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

399
00:22:44,470 --> 00:22:47,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

400
00:22:47,770 --> 00:22:50,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry...</font></b></font></font></font>

401
00:22:52,390 --> 00:22:55,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Bowl-cut, fuzzy eyelashes
and bushy eyebrows.</font>

402
00:22:55,470 --> 00:22:56,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Oh! It's you!</font>

403
00:22:56,770 --> 00:22:59,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You're the overly intense guy
who just got rejected by Sakura-chan.</font>

404
00:22:59,270 --> 00:23:01,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What's with your bizarre
green jumpsuit?</font>

405
00:23:01,730 --> 00:23:05,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What? You want to challenge me,
bushy-browed bumpkin?</font>

406
00:23:05,360 --> 00:23:08,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'll teach you that it's a million years
too soon to be doing that.</font>

407
00:23:09,570 --> 00:23:13,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next episode:
"Energy 120%. A Modern and Rocking Challenge!"</font>

408
00:23:13,870 --> 00:23:16,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">As for me,
I'm going to kick butt once again!</font>

